      "width": 343,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "ASSET MATERIALIZATION ADAPTER (~500 LOC)\n1. validate output vs contract (sdk/contracts.py)\n2. enforce partition constraints\n3. delegate atomic write to pyiceberg + catalog\n4. emit OpenLineage event (lineage.py)\n5. update run ledger + freshness + cost",
